    "The crypto-asset exchange service is provided by Zillion Bits Ltd (“ZBX”) , a company incorporated in Malta under Company Registration No. C 88757 , with registered office at Level 3 (Suite 2267), Tower Business Centre, Tower Street, Swatar, Birkirkara BKR 4013, Malta . Zillion Bits Ltd is authorised by the Malta Financial Services Authority (MFSA) as a Crypto-Asset Service Provider under the EU Markets in Crypto-Assets Regulation (MiCAR) under Authorisation ID ZBL-24354 . Zillion Bits Ltd also holds Authorisation ID ZBL-28410 for regulated payment services exclusively in relation to Electronic Money Tokens (EMTs). ZBX is authorised, among other services, to provide exchange of crypto-assets for funds, exchange of crypto-assets for other crypto-assets, execution of orders, crypto-asset transfers, and custody and administration of crypto-assets . Your exchange When you confirm a Fiat → Crypto or Crypto → Fiat transaction: the exchange transaction is executed by ZBX ; the applicable exchange rate, fees and estimated amount to be received will be displayed before you confirm the transaction; fiat and crypto-assets associated with the exchange are held, processed, safeguarded or custodied by ZBX and/or its appointed regulated banking, payment or custody providers , as applicable to the relevant service; once an exchange has been executed, it may not be possible to cancel or reverse the transaction ; the final amount received may differ slightly from an indicative quote where the quote is not expressly stated to be locked or guaranteed. Role of Hoppa Hoppa Global / Hoppacard provides the technology, user interface, API connectivity and integration through which the ZBX services are made available. Hoppa does not execute the crypto exchange transaction and does not itself hold, safeguard or custody the customer crypto-assets or fiat funds used in the exchange operation. The contractual and regulated crypto-asset service relating to the exchange is provided by Zillion Bits Ltd (ZBX) . Risk acknowledgement Crypto-assets can be highly volatile and may experience significant changes in value over a short period of time. Exchange transactions therefore involve financial risk, including the possible loss of part or all of the value of the crypto-assets involved. Crypto-assets may also be subject to liquidity, technology, blockchain, cybersecurity, counterparty and regulatory risks. The exchange service does not constitute investment, financial, tax or legal advice . You are responsible for determining whether a transaction is appropriate for you and for understanding any tax or legal obligations arising from your transaction. By confirming the exchange, you acknowledge that: you have reviewed the transaction details, exchange rate and applicable fees before confirming; you understand the nature and risks of crypto-assets and crypto-asset exchange transactions; you are acting on your own behalf unless otherwise expressly permitted; the funds and crypto-assets used for the transaction are lawfully owned or controlled by you; you authorise ZBX to execute the selected exchange transaction ; you agree to the applicable ZBX Terms of Business, Risk Disclosure, pricing and execution conditions ; and you understand the respective roles of ZBX as the regulated crypto-asset service provider and Hoppa as the technology and integration provider .";
